<a href="http://clickthru.online.com/Click?q=13-NxSZI3XPQSrqAZWssDLfzpHOCerR" >
<b>'Rainbow' coalition to spread wireless</b></a>
<P>

<!-- STORY 4 -->


   
<font size="+1"><b>More large-scale worm attacks? Brace yourself</b></a></font><br>


It's been a year since the <b>Code Red</b> worm wreaked havoc on the Net. What's changed? Internet worms have become <b>much 
more robust</b> since Code Red. And that doesn't bode well, since antivirus software hasn't kept up with all the changes. So 
